      englishText: `Al-Agharr Al-Muzani (May Allah be pleased with him) said: The Messenger of Allah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) said, "Sometimes I perceive a veil over my heart, and I supplicate Allah for forgiveness a hundred times in a day." [Muslim] .`,
