      englishText: `Abu Hurairah (May Allah be pleased with him) said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) saying, "I swear by Allah that I seek Allah's Pardon and turn to Him in repentance more than seventy times a day." [Al-Bukhari] .`,
