      englishText: `Jarir bin 'Abdullah (May Allah be pleased with him) reported: We were sitting with the Messenger of Allah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) when he looked at the full moon and observed, "You shall see your Rubb in the Hereafter as you are seeing this moon; and you will not feel the slightest inconvenience in seeing Him." [Al-Bukhari and Muslim] .`,
